msgid "Initialize your IBM Quantum Compute Service account {#initialize-your-ibm-quantum-compute-service-account}"
msgstr "Inisialisasi akun layanan Qiskit Runtime kamu {#initialize-your-qiskit-runtime-service-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Before using Qiskit Runtime, you have to initialize (instantiate) your account by submitting (loading) credentials.  These credentials can be manually submitted each time you initialize the Qiskit Runtime service, or you can save them for reuse.\n"
msgid "Before using the IBM Quantum&reg; Compute Service, you have to initialize (instantiate) your account by submitting (loading) credentials.  These credentials can be manually submitted each time you initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service, or you can save them for reuse.\n"
msgstr "Sebelum menggunakan Qiskit Runtime, kamu harus menginisialisasi (membuat instance) akunmu dengan mengirimkan (memuat) kredensial. Kredensial ini bisa dikirimkan secara manual setiap kali kamu menginisialisasi layanan Qiskit Runtime, atau kamu bisa menyimpannya untuk digunakan kembali.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"  * If you are using a public computer or other untrusted environment, follow the instructions in [Initialize the service in an untrusted environment](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted) instead.\n"
"  * Follow [these instructions](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) if you want to connect by using the REST API instead of using Qiskit.\n"
"  * If necessary, use [this information](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) to configure your firewall to enable access to the IBM Quantum API endpoints.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Catatan\">\n"
"      * Jika kamu menggunakan komputer umum atau lingkungan yang tidak terpercaya, ikuti petunjuk di [Inisialisasi layanan di lingkungan yang tidak terpercaya](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted).\n"
"      * Ikuti [petunjuk ini](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) jika kamu ingin terhubung menggunakan REST API, bukan Qiskit.\n"
"      * Jika perlu, gunakan [informasi ini](/guides/quickstart-steps-org#firewall) untuk mengonfigurasi firewall agar bisa mengakses endpoint API IBM Quantum.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that you have completed these steps:\n"
msgstr "Pastikan kamu sudah menyelesaikan langkah-langkah berikut:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure that you are a member of an IBM Cloud account.  See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for instructions.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan kamu adalah anggota akun IBM Cloud. Lihat [Siapkan akun IBM Cloud kamu](/guides/cloud-setup) untuk petunjuknya.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create (or have access to) at least one instance. Follow these steps to verify:\n"
msgstr "Buat (atau miliki akses ke) setidaknya satu instance. Ikuti langkah-langkah ini untuk memverifikasi:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"
msgstr "Login ke [IBM Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure that the correct account and region are selected in the account switcher in the header.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan akun dan wilayah yang benar sudah dipilih di pemilih akun di header.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have one or more instances shown, you're done with this step. Otherwise, [create an instance](/guides/instances#add-instance).\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu sudah memiliki satu atau lebih instance yang ditampilkan, langkah ini selesai. Jika belum, [buat sebuah instance.](/guides/instances#add-instance)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ensure you are working in an active Python environment with the [Qiskit SDK and `qiskit-ibm-runtime` installed](/guides/install-qiskit#local).\n"
msgstr "Pastikan kamu bekerja di lingkungan Python aktif dengan [Qiskit SDK dan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` yang sudah terinstal.](/guides/install-qiskit#local)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate the Python virtual environment and run Python in your virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan virtual environment Python dan jalankan Python di virtual environment tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"access-credentials\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your access credentials {#find-your-access-credentials}"
msgstr "Temukan kredensial akses kamu {#find-your-access-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Find your API key (also referred to as an  _API token_). From the [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), create your API key, then copy it to a secure location so you can use it for authentication. The token will not be visible again. Note that you can use a single API key to connect to any region.\n"
msgstr "Temukan API key kamu (juga disebut sebagai _API token_). Dari [dashboard](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/), buat API key kamu, lalu salin ke lokasi yang aman agar bisa digunakan untuk autentikasi. Token ini tidak akan terlihat lagi. Perlu diketahui bahwa kamu bisa menggunakan satu API key untuk terhubung ke wilayah mana pun.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optional: Find the instance you want to use from the [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page. Hover over its CRN, click the icon to copy it, then save it in a secure location so you can use it to identify the instance.\n"
msgstr "Opsional: Temukan instance yang ingin kamu gunakan dari halaman [Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances). Arahkan kursor ke CRN-nya, klik ikon untuk menyalinnya, lalu simpan di lokasi yang aman agar bisa digunakan untuk mengidentifikasi instance tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Connect Qiskit with your Qiskit Runtime service instance {#connect-qiskit-with-your-qiskit-runtime-service-instance}"
msgid "Connect Qiskit with your IBM Quantum Compute Service instance {#connect-qiskit-with-your-ibm-quantum-compute-service-instance}"
msgstr "Hubungkan Qiskit dengan instance layanan Qiskit Runtime kamu {#connect-qiskit-with-your-qiskit-runtime-service-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"These instructions are designed for `qiskit_ibm_runtime` v0.42 or later. Some features are not enabled in earlier versions of `qiskit_ibm_runtime`. In these cases, you should always provide a value for `channel`, `token`, and `instance`, either explicitly or through a saved account.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Petunjuk ini dirancang untuk `qiskit_ibm_runtime` v0.42 atau lebih baru. Beberapa fitur tidak tersedia di versi `qiskit_ibm_runtime` yang lebih lama. Dalam kasus seperti ini, kamu harus selalu memberikan nilai untuk `channel`, `token`, dan `instance`, baik secara eksplisit maupun melalui akun yang tersimpan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The basic code to connect Qiskit with your Quantum Compute instance follows.  However, there are several different ways to customize the `QiskitRuntimeService` options, depending on your needs.  These options are described in the following sections.\n"
msgstr "Berikut adalah kode dasar untuk menghubungkan Qiskit dengan instance Quantum Compute kamu. Namun, ada beberapa cara berbeda untuk menyesuaikan opsi `QiskitRuntimeService`, tergantung kebutuhanmu. Opsi-opsi ini dijelaskan di bagian berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The default channel is `ibm_quantum_platform`.  Because this is almost always the appropriate channel, it is not included in the examples.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Channel default adalah `ibm_quantum_platform`. Karena ini hampir selalu merupakan channel yang tepat, channel ini tidak disertakan dalam contoh-contoh.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"explicit\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"explicit\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start path: Specify credentials explicitly {#quick-start-path-specify-credentials-explicitly}"
msgstr "Jalur cepat: Tentukan kredensial secara eksplisit {#quick-start-path-specify-credentials-explicitly}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The fastest way to get a `QiskitRuntimeService` instance running is the direct instantiation method: explicitly provide the API token (key) and CRN (instance identifier) every time you need to initialize IBM Quantum Compute Service. See [Find your access credentials](#access-credentials) if necessary.\n"
msgstr "Cara tercepat untuk menjalankan instance `QiskitRuntimeService` adalah metode instansiasi langsung: berikan API token (key) dan CRN (identifier instance) secara eksplisit setiap kali kamu perlu menginisialisasi IBM Quantum Compute Service. Lihat [Temukan kredensial akses kamu](#access-credentials) jika perlu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This path is reliable but can be tedious if you need to load the same details repeatedly. To avoid loading your credentials multiple times, if you are working in a trusted Python environment (such as on a personal laptop or workstation), you can use saved account credentials, as described in the following section.\n"
msgstr "Jalur ini andal tetapi bisa membosankan jika kamu perlu memuat detail yang sama berulang kali. Untuk menghindari memuat kredensial berkali-kali, jika kamu bekerja di lingkungan Python yang terpercaya (seperti di laptop atau workstation pribadi), kamu bisa menggunakan kredensial akun yang tersimpan, seperti yang dijelaskan di bagian berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Although the `instance` input parameter is optional, it is recommended that you always provide this information, unless you want to use a single service to work with several instances. In this situation, see the [automatic instance selection](#auto-select) section.\n"
msgstr "Meskipun parameter input `instance` bersifat opsional, disarankan agar kamu selalu memberikan informasi ini, kecuali jika kamu ingin menggunakan satu layanan untuk bekerja dengan beberapa instance. Dalam situasi ini, lihat bagian [pemilihan instance otomatis](#auto-select).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"saved\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"saved\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Quick start path: Specify saved credentials {#quick-start-path-specify-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Jalur cepat: Tentukan kredensial yang tersimpan {#quick-start-path-specify-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you have already saved your credentials, use the following code to apply your default credentials. For instructions to save credentials, see [Save your access credentials](/guides/save-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu sudah menyimpan kredensial, gunakan kode berikut untuk menerapkan kredensial default kamu. Untuk petunjuk menyimpan kredensial, lihat [Simpan kredensial akses kamu.](/guides/save-credentials)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you named one or more sets of credentials - for example, for open and premium access - use the following code to use a set of named credentials.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu memberi nama satu atau lebih set kredensial - misalnya, untuk akses open dan premium - gunakan kode berikut untuk menggunakan set kredensial yang dinamai.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations when loading saved credentials {#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials}"
msgstr "Pertimbangan saat memuat kredensial yang tersimpan {#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials}"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you initialize a service with `token` and `name`, the `token` is ignored and the saved details from the `name` account are loaded.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu menginisialisasi layanan dengan `token` dan `name`, `token` diabaikan dan detail yang tersimpan dari akun `name` dimuat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the service loads the details from `account_A` and does not use `token_B`:\n"
msgstr "    Pada contoh berikut, layanan memuat detail dari `account_A` dan tidak menggunakan `token_B`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(token=\"token_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you provide a `name` and an `instance` when initializing a service, the service tries to load the `name` account **and** connect to the specified `instance`. If there is any conflict, a warning is raised.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(token=\"token_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Jika kamu memberikan `name` dan `instance` saat menginisialisasi layanan, layanan akan mencoba memuat akun `name` **dan** terhubung ke `instance` yang ditentukan. Jika ada konflik, peringatan akan muncul.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the service tries to load the credentials for `account_A` and use instance `CRN_B` - even if there is a different instance specified in `account_A`:\n"
msgstr "    Pada contoh berikut, layanan mencoba memuat kredensial untuk `account_A` dan menggunakan instance `CRN_B` - meskipun ada instance berbeda yang ditentukan di `account_A`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- The service tries to load the default saved account only if you don't provide a `token` or `name` when initializing a service.  However, if an `instance` is provided explicitly, the service tries to connect to that instance by using the default credentials. If there is any conflict, a warning is raised.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\", name=\"account_A\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Layanan mencoba memuat akun tersimpan default hanya jika kamu tidak memberikan `token` atau `name` saat menginisialisasi layanan. Namun, jika `instance` diberikan secara eksplisit, layanan mencoba terhubung ke instance tersebut menggunakan kredensial default. Jika ada konflik, peringatan akan muncul.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the service tries to load the default credentials and use the instance `CRN_B` - even if there is a different instance specified in the default account:\n"
msgstr "    Pada contoh berikut, layanan mencoba memuat kredensial default dan menggunakan instance `CRN_B` - meskipun ada instance berbeda yang ditentukan di akun default:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you save multiple sets of credentials but don't specify one when initializing the service and there is no default saved account, the one whose name comes last alphabetically is used.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService(instance=\"CRN_B\")\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Jika kamu menyimpan beberapa set kredensial tetapi tidak menentukan salah satunya saat menginisialisasi layanan dan tidak ada akun tersimpan default, maka yang namanya paling akhir secara alfabetis yang akan digunakan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    In the following example, the user saved accounts named \"my_premium\" and \"my_open\" but didn't mark either as the dfault.  They then initialized the service by using the following code. In this case, the \"my_premium\" credentials are used:\n"
msgstr "    Pada contoh berikut, pengguna menyimpan akun bernama \"my_premium\" dan \"my_open\" tetapi tidak menandai salah satunya sebagai default. Kemudian mereka menginisialisasi layanan menggunakan kode berikut. Dalam kasus ini, kredensial \"my_premium\" yang digunakan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    ```\n"
"- If you are persistently getting the error \"401 Unauthorized\", you might be trying to use a [bearer token](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment) instead of your API key.\n"
msgstr ""
"    service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"    ```\n"
"- Jika kamu terus-menerus mendapatkan error \"401 Unauthorized\", mungkin kamu sedang mencoba menggunakan [bearer token](/guides/cloud-setup-untrusted#authenticate-to-the-rest-api-in-an-untrusted-environment) alih-alih API key kamu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"auto-select\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automatically select the instance {#automatically-select-the-instance}"
msgstr "Pilih instance secara otomatis {#automatically-select-the-instance}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you provide a token but **don't provide an instance CRN** when instantiating the service, `QiskitRuntimeService` authenticates to the account identified by the token and uses automatic instance selection to choose the most relevant instance for the requested task. If you have several instances available within your account, the service automatically chooses from the available instances, depending on the resource requested and these `QiskitRuntimeService` options (if set): `plans_preference`, `region`, `tags`.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu memberikan token tetapi **tidak memberikan CRN instance** saat membuat instance layanan, `QiskitRuntimeService` mengautentikasi ke akun yang diidentifikasi oleh token tersebut dan menggunakan pemilihan instance otomatis untuk memilih instance yang paling relevan untuk tugas yang diminta. Jika kamu memiliki beberapa instance yang tersedia dalam akunmu, layanan secara otomatis memilih dari instance yang tersedia, tergantung pada sumber daya yang diminta dan opsi `QiskitRuntimeService` ini (jika diatur): `plans_preference`, `region`, `tags`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`plans_preference`**: The types of instance plans to prioritize. For example, if [`open`] is passed in, only Open Plan instances are available. Accepted values are `open`, `premium`, `pay-as-you-go`, `flex`, and `on-prem`. If `plans_preference` is not specified, free plans are prioritized over paid plans.\n"
msgstr "**`plans_preference`**: Jenis paket instance yang diprioritaskan. Misalnya, jika [`open`] dimasukkan, hanya instance Open Plan yang tersedia. Nilai yang diterima adalah `open`, `premium`, `pay-as-you-go`, `flex`, dan `on-prem`. Jika `plans_preference` tidak ditentukan, paket gratis diprioritaskan di atas paket berbayar.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`region`**: The instance region. Accepted values are `us-east` and `eu-de`.\n"
msgstr "**`region`**: Wilayah instance. Nilai yang diterima adalah `us-east` dan `eu-de`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**`tags`**: The instance tags. Accepts a list of tag name strings.\n"
msgstr "**`tags`**: Tag instance. Menerima daftar string nama tag.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"You can set up your [saved credentials](/guides/save-credentials) to automatically select an instance.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kamu bisa mengatur [kredensial tersimpan](/guides/save-credentials) untuk memilih instance secara otomatis.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The instance is found and used in this order:\n"
msgstr "Instance ditemukan dan digunakan dalam urutan ini:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account only has access to one instance, it is selected by default.\n"
msgstr "Jika akunmu hanya memiliki akses ke satu instance, instance tersebut dipilih secara default.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If saved credentials are being used and an instance was specified with the credentials, that instance is used. See [Considerations when loading saved credentials](#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials).\n"
msgstr "Jika kredensial yang tersimpan sedang digunakan dan sebuah instance ditentukan bersama kredensial tersebut, instance itu yang digunakan. Lihat [Pertimbangan saat memuat kredensial yang tersimpan.](#considerations-when-loading-saved-credentials)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account has multiple instances that can access the requested QPU, the system uses your specified plan preferences to choose a plan and instance. For `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42 and later, free plans are prioritized by default.\n"
msgstr "Jika akunmu memiliki beberapa instance yang bisa mengakses QPU yang diminta, sistem menggunakan preferensi paket yang kamu tentukan untuk memilih paket dan instance. Untuk `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.42 dan yang lebih baru, paket gratis diprioritaskan secara default.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your account has access to multiple instances but only one can access the requested QPU, the instance with access is selected. If this instance is not associated with a free plan, a cost will be incurred.\n"
msgstr "Jika akunmu memiliki akses ke beberapa instance tetapi hanya satu yang bisa mengakses QPU yang diminta, instance yang memiliki akses dipilih. Jika instance ini tidak terkait dengan paket gratis, biaya akan dikenakan.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples {#examples}"
msgstr "Contoh {#examples}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to the account to find ones that can access the specified backend:\n"
msgstr "Pada contoh ini, layanan mencari semua instance yang tersedia untuk akun guna menemukan yang bisa mengakses Backend yang ditentukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to the account in the EU region to find ones that can access the specified backend:\n"
msgstr "Pada contoh ini, layanan mencari semua instance yang tersedia untuk akun di wilayah EU guna menemukan yang bisa mengakses Backend yang ditentukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all instances that are available to the account and are tagged as `services` to find ones that can access the specified backend:\n"
msgstr "Pada contoh ini, layanan mencari semua instance yang tersedia untuk akun dan diberi tag `services` guna menemukan yang bisa mengakses Backend yang ditentukan:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this example, the service searches all premium and open instances that are available to the account to find ones that can access the specified backend. If a backend is in both a Premium and an Open Plan instance, the Premium Plan instance is prioritized because `premium` is specified first in `plans_preference`.\n"
msgstr "Pada contoh ini, layanan mencari semua instance premium dan open yang tersedia untuk akun guna menemukan yang bisa mengakses Backend yang ditentukan. Jika sebuah Backend ada di instance paket Premium maupun Open, instance paket Premium diprioritaskan karena `premium` ditentukan lebih dulu di `plans_preference`.\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Determine which instance was chosen {#determine-which-instance-was-chosen}"
msgstr "Tentukan instance mana yang dipilih {#determine-which-instance-was-chosen}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The selected instance is returned as a warning. Additionally, you can run `service.active_instance()` to determine the active instance.\n"
msgstr "Instance yang dipilih dikembalikan sebagai peringatan. Selain itu, kamu bisa menjalankan `service.active_instance()` untuk menentukan instance yang aktif.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Local testing with `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#local-testing-with-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"
msgstr "Pengujian lokal dengan `qiskit-ibm-runtime` {#local-testing-with-qiskit-ibm-runtime}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `QiskitRuntimeService` class can be initialized with `channel=local` to perform local simulation. In this case, authentication is not required and there is no need to provide values for `token` or `instance`. Therefore, it is not recommended that you save a local account.  Instead, you can do direct instantiation:\n"
msgstr "Kelas `QiskitRuntimeService` bisa diinisialisasi dengan `channel=local` untuk melakukan simulasi lokal. Dalam kasus ini, autentikasi tidak diperlukan dan tidak perlu memberikan nilai untuk `token` atau `instance`. Oleh karena itu, tidak disarankan untuk menyimpan akun lokal. Sebagai gantinya, kamu bisa melakukan instansiasi langsung:\n"

